    {"id":"6af1a1ed-f27b-4003-86b1-2dcf6a54e958","name":"Sticky Note 0bdcc165","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[1008,1280],"parameters":{"content":"## Review Request & Response\nAn appointment ending starts a review-request cycle tracked in the \"review_requests\" Data Table (replaces the Wait 24h / Wait 5d chain from the spec with a daily scheduler + stage machine, per n8n best practice for long delays). Stage PENDING sends the review-request SMS after 24h; AWAITING_REVIEW checks Google Business Profile for a matching new review by reviewer name after 5 days; when found, AI drafts a reply and a Gmail draft asks the dentist to approve; approving forwards/replies and a Gmail trigger posts it via Google Business Profile. Reviewer-to-patient matching is best-effort (by first name + date), since Google reviews are not tied to patient records.","color":4}}
